<g id="voyageMenu">
<g id="routeCard0"><rect class="routeBG" width="480" height="208" rx="19" fill="#112d35" stroke="#5c9e8e"/><path d="M26 27h22m-11-11v22M29 76q22-17 53-11" stroke="#acdccc" fill="none"/><text x="82" y="47" fill="#d9f6d8" font-size="30" font-weight="800">江风兜风</text><text x="25" y="94" fill="#a4c7c2" font-size="18">90秒慢跑 / 不扣耐心 / 完成40币</text><text id="menuCruise" x="25" y="125" fill="#8eadae" font-size="17">赏衣服，练跳跃，捞金币，不必赶路。</text></g>@BUTTON:routePlay0:出门兜风@
<g id="routeCard1"><rect class="routeBG" width="480" height="208" rx="19" fill="#25283a" stroke="#988496"/><path d="M30 24h34v41H30ZM38 35h17m-17 9h17" stroke="#ddc0ea" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="82" y="47" fill="#e6dcf6" font-size="30" font-weight="800">街头委托</text><text id="menuContract" x="25" y="94" fill="#b6afce" font-size="17">60秒 / 基础60 + 每单25币</text><text x="25" y="125" fill="#918baa" font-size="17">咖啡、清障、擦身 / 全装备均可接。</text></g>@BUTTON:routePlay1:接单开跑@
<g id="routeCard2"><rect class="routeBG" width="480" height="208" rx="19" fill="#2b2830" stroke="#b39477"/><path d="M37 24a20 20 0 1 1-7 27m-1-12v14h14" stroke="#edc58d" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="82" y="47" fill="#f7dbac" font-size="30" font-weight="800">凌晨循环</text><text id="menuEndless" x="25" y="94" fill="#c6b299" font-size="17">3格耐心 / 每30秒20币</text><text x="25" y="125" fill="#a69986" font-size="17">60秒起镀章挡被动技能 / 随时收工。</text></g>@BUTTON:routePlay2:走进夜路@
<g id="routeCard3"><rect class="routeBG" width="480" height="208" rx="19" fill="#162b3a" stroke="#7d9bac"/><path d="M30 25h31v39H30Zm6 8h19v20H36Z" stroke="#adcde4" fill="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="82" y="47" fill="#d0e7fa" font-size="30" font-weight="800">拆机道场</text><text id="menuDojo" x="25" y="94" fill="#a2bfcd" font-size="17">直接挑战三阶段Boss / 练习不发金币</text><text x="25" y="125" fill="#879fae" font-size="17">主线不动 / 看预警，等绿盾，再反击。</text></g>@BUTTON:routePlay3:练练拆机@
